        `& 3` -> `& 1`  collides words 0 and 2  -> `alias2`    (12/13, 13-row)
        `/ 4` -> `/ 2`  collides words 0 and 2  -> `alias2`    (12/13, 13-row)
        `& 3` -> `& 7`  goes OUT OF BOUNDS       -> `crossarr` (12/13, 13-row)
