    cnt == 408 accepted  ->  d->data != NULL  ->  tail sets COND_DATA_AVAIL   -> 0xa8
    cnt != 408 declined  ->  d->data == NULL  ->  tail CLEARS it, cnt = 0     -> 0xa0

Both values are DERIVED, not fitted: the guest writes 0xa0 to GDROM_COND to start the
