       so a struct REORDER unpins it exactly as it unpins `crossarr`.
       Anchoring buys decode-absoluteness, not layout-independence.
  (iii) ARRAY GEOMETRY IS OUT OF CONTRACT.  `uint32_t mask_13[3]` ->
