#  distinct and it goes GREEN.  `crossarr` pins a cross-array pair that `& 1`
#  also leaves distinct, so it goes green too.  What `& 1` actually collides is
#  words 0 and TWO -- +0x18 maps to (0x18/4) & 1 == 0, onto +0x10.
